tps://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msi","state":"uploaded","size":13856768,"digest":"sha256:f5e567f5beb56eb6368f01f5fc68c384dd957b7b4dfa41a663582f23c5bb6f56","download_count":6037,"created_at":"2026-11-18T00:18:33Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T00:18:34Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/cli/cli/releases/download/v2.105.0/gh_2.105.0_windows_arm64.msi"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cli/cli/releases/assets/761188796","id":761188796,"node_id":"RA_kwDODKw3uc4tXtG8","name":"gh_2.105.0_windows_arm64.zip","label":"GitHub CLI 2.105.0 windows arm64","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":13650151,"digest":"sha256:5282a09c7757210c6e2dfb11a56b11e14e646df9b3b6a49f155465f5f881c3b7","download_count":551,"created_at":"2026-11-18T00:18:34Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T00:18:35Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/cli/cli/releases/download/v2.105.0/gh_2.105.0_windows_arm64.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cli/cli/tarball/v2.105.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cli/cli/zipball/v2.105.0","body":"## What's Changed\r\n\r\n## Subscribe to GitHub Event Streams with `gh event` (preview)\r\n\r\nThe new `gh event` command set lets agents, integrations, and scripts wait for pull request changes instead of polling GitHub:\r\n\r\n```shell\r\n# Wait for a review event\r\ngh event listen --resource https://github.com/OWNER/REPO/pull/NUMBER --event com.github.pull_request.review.submitted.v1 --timeout 30m\r\n\r\n# Wait for a check suite completion event\r\ngh event listen --resource https://github.com/OWNER/REPO/pull/NUMBER --event com.github.pull_request.check_suite.status.changed.v1 --jq .data.conclusion\r\n\r\n# List active event subscriptions\r\ngh event subscription list\r\n```\r\n\r\nBy default, `gh event listen` exits after the first event. Use `--count` to wait for several events or `--follow` to keep listening. Events are printed as CloudEvent JSON objects, with `data.api_url` pointing to the resource that changed.\r\n\r\nSupported events include submitted reviews, pull request state and head changes, merge conflicts, and completed check suites. The `subscription create`, `list`, `view`, and `delete` commands manage subscriptions directly.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> GitHub Event Streams is in preview. [Join the wait list](https://gh.io/event-streams-signup), read the [announcement](https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-event-streams-is-now-in-preview), or see the [Event Streams documentation](https://docs.github.com/en/integrations/how-tos/using-github-event-streams).\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n\r\n### ✨ Features\r\n\r\n* Add a server-sent events reader and Event Subscriptions API client by @babakks in [#15071](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15071)\r\n* Add `gh event listen` to wait for pull request events without polling by @babakks in [#15072](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15072)\r\n* Add `gh event subscription list` by @babakks in [#15073](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15073)\r\n* Add `gh event subscription create` by @babakks in [#15074](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15074)\r\n* Add `gh event subscription view` by @babakks in [#15075](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15075)\r\n* Add `gh event subscription delete` by @babakks in [#15076](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15076)\r\n* Suggest `gh event listen` to agents using `gh pr` and `gh api` by @babakks in [#15077](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15077)\r\n* Support check suite events and suggest them from `gh run view` and `gh run watch` by @babakks in [#15081](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15081)\r\n\r\n### 🐛 Fixes\r\n\r\n* fix(event listen): print each event without waiting for the next heartbeat by @babakks and @iancanderson in [#15079](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15079)\r\n* fix(event listen): report deleted subscriptions clearly by @babakks in [#15080](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15080)\r\n* fix(event): improve stream framing, `Retry-After` handling, evals, and regression coverage by @babakks in [#15083](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15083)\r\n\r\n### 📚 Docs & Chores\r\n\r\n* Make issue-triage formatting checks nonblocking by @BagToad in [#15052](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15052)\r\n* Add event-driven agent evals, `gh` skill guidance, and preview documentation by @babakks in [#15078](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15078)\r\n\r\n### :dependabot: Dependencies\r\n\r\n* chore(deps): bump `golang.org/x/text` from 0.43.0 to 0.44.0 by @dependabot in [#15049](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15049)\r\n* chore(deps): bump `golang.org/x/term` from 0.47.0 to 0.48.0 by @dependabot in [#15048](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15048)\r\n* chore(deps): bump `golang.org/x/crypto` from 0.58.0 to 0.59.0 by @dependabot in [#15064](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15064)\r\n* chore(deps): bump `zod` from 4.3.6 to 4.6.6 in `evals` by @dependabot in [#15086](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15086)\r\n* chore(deps): bump `@hono/node-server` from 2.1.5 to 2.1.9 in `evals` by @dependabot in [#15085](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15085)\r\n* chore(deps): bump `hono` from 4.13.13 to 4.13.19 in `evals` by @dependabot in [#15084](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15084)\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/cli/cli/compare/v2.104.0...v2.105.0","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cli/cli/releases/449359903/reactions","total_count":12,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":7,"confused":0,"heart":5,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":4}